atch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119625.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-22T16:09:09Z"},"body":"The fallback text server renders visible spaces in place of zero-width spaces at the end of labels:\r\n\r\n* It lacks detection for `0x2060` (⁠WORD JOINER) and `0xFEFF` (ZERO WIDTH NO-BREAK SPACE)\r\n* It did not respect \"preserve_control\" when detecting these\r\n* It does not hard-reset \"advance\" after falling back to a regular space for calculations\r\n* It does not hard-reset the glyph index to 0 to not render the glyph at all\r\n\r\nThis fixes both visible spaces if the font has it, and hex-box glyph fallbacks if the font has no `0x0020` space.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #119623\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n* I copied the bugfix of #111014 as I understood it\r\n* I tested manually as described in the reproducer in #119623\r\n* I did use Claude to help me navigate/understand the change and be ready to \"defend it\"\r\n* Any issue, pr, comment I post is written manually with my human brain\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":fa